For non-`0.72em` ratios, add a variant in `globals.css` (e.g. `text-body-copy-sm`) rather than per-component `px` overrides.

## Anti-patterns

- Changing global root fluid scale in `globals.css` for paragraph legibility
- Applying `text-body-copy` to headings, labels, or decorative mono stamps
- Mixing `text-[14px]` / `text-base` overrides on individual components when `text-body-copy` exists
